    "description": "## Summary\n\nAutomated version bump to v0.4.20 for the stable release. Syncs the version across all five canonical locations via `bump-version.ts` so the release tag can be cut on `main`.\n\n## Related Issue\n\nNo related issue — routine release version bump.\n\n## Type of Change\n\n- [ ] feat: new feature\n- [ ] fix: bug fix\n- [ ] docs: documentation only\n- [ ] style: formatting or non-functional styling changes\n- [ ] refactor: internal cleanup with no behavior change\n- [ ] perf: performance improvement\n- [ ] test: adds or updates tests\n- [ ] build: build or dependency changes\n- [ ] ci: CI/CD workflow changes\n- [ ] revert: reverts a previous change\n\n## What Changed\n\n- `package.json`: 0.4.18 → 0.4.20\n- `src-tauri/Cargo.toml` + `src-tauri/Cargo.lock`: 0.4.18 → 0.4.20\n- `src-tauri/tauri.conf.json`: 0.4.18 → 0.4.20\n- `src/renderer/components/ProjectSidebar.tsx`: sidebar version label → v0.4.20\n\n## How It Was Tested\n\n- [ ] `bun run ci` (Biome lint + format + imports, strict mode)\n- [ ] `cargo clippy --all-targets -- -D warnings` (in src-tauri)\n- [ ] `cargo test` (in src-tauri)\n- [ ] Not applicable\n\n## Screenshots or Recordings\n\nNot applicable — version strings only.\n\n## CI & Review Gate\n\n- [ ] All CI checks pass (PR Validation, Rust Checks, Build Verification, Security Scans)\n- [ ] Code review comments from CodeRabbit / Claude have been addressed or resolved\n- [ ] No unresolved review findings remain\n\n## Checklist\n\n<!-- CURSOR_SUMMARY -->\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> **Low Risk**\n> Version-string-only changes with no logic, security, or data-handling impact.\n> \n> **Overview**\n> **Release v0.4.20** — bumps the app version from **0.4.18** to **0.4.20** in `package.json`, `src-tauri/Cargo.toml`, `src-tauri/Cargo.lock`, and `src-tauri/tauri.conf.json` so npm, Rust, and Tauri bundles stay aligned for tagging and the updater.\n> \n> The project sidebar footer label is updated from **Termul v0.4.15** to **v0.4.20**, bringing the on-screen version in line with the release metadata (no functional behavior change).\n> \n> <sup>Reviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit 4d6bb963ddc8d767dc45139e79db1fdeda7499d8. Bugbot is set up for automated code reviews on this repo. Configure [here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).</sup>\n<!-- /CURSOR_SUMMARY -->",
